---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import LegalHeader from '../components/LegalHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | Kabeli Software Solution FZ-LLC';
const description = 'Learn how Kabeli handles business enquiries, website technical data, and privacy requests.';
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy"><div class="page"><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><LegalHeader />
<main id="main" class="legal"><p class="lbl">LEGAL / 01</p><h1 class="disp">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="mono legal-date">Effective 17 October 2026</p>
<p>This Privacy Policy describes how Kabeli Software Solution FZ-LLC (“Kabeli”, “we”, “us”) handles personal information through <a href="https://kabeli.ae">kabeli.ae</a> and when you contact us. It applies to this public website and initial business enquiries; services delivered under a client agreement may have separate privacy terms.</p>
<h2>1. Who is responsible</h2><p>Kabeli Software Solution FZ-LLC, Ras Al Khaimah, United Arab Emirates. For privacy questions and requests, write to <a href="mailto:hello@kabeli.ae">hello@kabeli.ae</a>.</p>
<h2>2. Information we receive</h2><p>When you email us, we receive the information you choose to provide, such as your name, email, company, and project details. Our hosting and infrastructure providers may automatically process technical information such as IP addresses, browser information, request timestamps, and error logs to deliver and protect the website.</p>
<h2>3. Contact form and cookies</h2><p>The website's enquiry form opens your device's email application with a prefilled draft. The form does not submit information to a Kabeli website database. Your email is sent only when you choose to send it from your email application. This site does not intentionally set non-essential analytics or advertising cookies in its current implementation. Third-party services, including externally hosted fonts and our hosting provider, may process technical information under their own policies.</p>
<h2>4. Purposes and lawful processing</h2><p>We use information to respond to enquiries, evaluate potential projects, communicate with business contacts, protect website operations, and comply with applicable legal obligations. Where required by applicable law, we rely on an appropriate lawful basis such as responding to your request, legitimate business interests, compliance with law, or consent.</p>
<h2>5. Sharing and international processing</h2><p>We may share information with providers supporting website hosting, email, security, and business operations, or where legally required. These providers may process data outside the UAE. We do not sell personal information.</p>
<h2>6. Retention and security</h2><p>We retain enquiry correspondence only for as long as reasonably needed to handle enquiries, maintain appropriate business records, resolve disputes, or meet legal obligations. Retention varies with the nature of a conversation and applicable requirements. We take reasonable organisational and technical security measures, although no internet transmission is completely secure.</p>
<h2>7. Your choices and rights</h2><p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, deletion, or information about our handling of your personal data, and may withdraw consent where our processing relies on it. Contact <a href="mailto:hello@kabeli.ae">hello@kabeli.ae</a>; we may need to verify your identity before acting on a request.</p>
<h2>8. External links and children</h2><p>External websites have their own privacy practices. This website is intended for business audiences and is not directed at children.</p>
<h2>9. Changes</h2><p>We may revise this notice to reflect changes in the website, our business, or applicable law. We will update the effective date when we make material revisions.</p>
<h2>10. Contact</h2><p>Kabeli Software Solution FZ-LLC<br/>Ras Al Khaimah, United Arab Emirates<br/><a href="mailto:hello@kabeli.ae">hello@kabeli.ae</a></p>
</main><SiteFooter /></div></Base>
